&lt;li&gt;Passion for crunching numbers, analyzing data, and navigating Excel/Google sheet spreadsheets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess high attention to detail and be able to execute with a high degree of accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Max experience is a must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on product feed management and shopping experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
