&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Experience in the biotechnology, biomedical, pharmaceutical, life sciences, or related industries is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Familiar with the process and methods of marketing campaign planning, execution and analysis, as well as with digital marketing channels and strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Experience planning and executing large-scale online and offline marketing campaigns, programs, and events is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Strong market insight, analytical skills, and strategic thinking capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Excellent organizational, coordination, and communication skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively with cross-functional stakeholders, including product managers, regional managers, and media &amp;amp; connection team, to maximize campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities, projects, and deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;x_MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Fluent spoken and written English, with excellent reading, writing, and presentation skills.&lt;/li&gt;
