&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;You also own&amp;nbsp;the proof. References, case studies, and advocates are how we win deals and how an acquirer values us. That program is yours to build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
